*Status:* _Released_

_Bogwalker_ is Minesweeper but with mines that work a little differently. You play as a _bogwalker_ — a man who walks in the bog — and you try to avoid crocodiles.

There are crocodiles hidden in the water and they make the water move. The numbers tell you how much the water is moving.

#image("bogwalker.gif", width: 100%)

It features a beautiful caustics shader and live fish!

